3172680/extras/eb89a1cda5fd01cd98476771cb515f99.poster.avif?t=1730347180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172680/extras/eb89a1cda5fd01cd98476771cb515f99.apng?t=1730347180\" class=\"bb_img\" width=16 height=16 /></picture></span> Life or death. The fate of the mission depends on your actions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172680/extras/e8410678d3e9e4bc016251b018749a13.poster.avif?t=1730347180\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172680/extras/e8410678d3e9e4bc016251b018749a13.gif?t=1730347180\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>This is the first game I\u2019ve ever worked on where I did everything on my own. I don\u2019t know if I accomplished what I set out to do. I do know that I did what I was always going to do. I created a game of a particular time and place. Not a game in a style or spirit, but a game that might very well have actually existed  long ago even though it did not. Against reason, this game contains several things both good and bad with the aim of performing at least a few miracles. May one of them steal you to that very particular place, whether you\u2019ve been there before or not. Become frustrated and confused, so that you might persevere and be victorious.<br><br>-GBG<br><br>Contra Mundus<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172680/extras/451557d6d9bcf49c532b5d1f506df16e.avif?t=1730347180\" width=594 height=69 /></span>",
